  "description": "PIWPAQ crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C82 H140 Fe2 N1 Nd9 O55. From the CIF bond table, Nd1 (Nd) has 9 O neighbors; Nd2 (Nd) has 9 O neighbors; Nd3 (Nd) has 8 O neighbors; Nd4 (Nd) has 8 O neighbors; Nd5 (Nd) has 8 O neighbors; Nd6 (Nd) has 8 O neighbors; Nd7 (Nd) has 8 O neighbors; Nd8 (Nd) has 9 O neighbors; Nd9 (Nd) has 8 O neighbors; Fe1 (Fe) has 6 O neighbors; Fe2 (Fe) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 24 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.482-4.130 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 92.30-133.74°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Nd9Fe2(μ4-O)(μ3-OH)14(acac)16(NO3)(CH3OH)2(H2O)3]. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 1 μ4-O (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 14 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 1 NO3 (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 3 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
